    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists won't change the fact that my life isn't mine anymore. every single day is just more of the same. i wake up and i just feel this heavy dread because i know what the next 12 hours look like. it's like i'm just a ghost living in someone else's struggle. i just want it to stop. i just want to be able to rest for real.",
